MODULE: posts/ui
FILES: src/app/admin/(admin)/posts/page.tsx, src/app/admin/(admin)/posts/new/page.tsx, src/app/admin/(admin)/posts/[id]/edit/page.tsx, src/app/admin/(admin)/categories/page.tsx, src/app/admin/(admin)/tags/page.tsx, src/app/posts/page.tsx, src/app/posts/[slug]/page.tsx, src/app/posts/[slug]/post-content.tsx, src/app/tags/[slug]/page.tsx, src/app/categories/page.tsx, src/app/categories/[slug]/page.tsx, src/components/post-form.tsx, src/components/post-card.tsx, src/components/pagination.tsx, src/components/tiptap-editor.tsx, src/lib/related-posts.ts, src/components/related-posts.tsx
RESPONSIBILITY: post/category/tag admin UI, public post/category/tag viewers with syntax highlighting
KEY_FILES:
- src/app/admin/(admin)/posts/page.tsx: post list with table, status filter, sort dropdown, pagination
- src/app/admin/(admin)/posts/new/page.tsx: create post page wrapping PostForm
- src/app/admin/(admin)/posts/[id]/edit/page.tsx: edit post page wrapping PostForm with data fetch
- src/app/admin/(admin)/categories/page.tsx: category list with inline create/edit/delete, post counts
- src/app/admin/(admin)/tags/page.tsx: tag list with inline create/edit/delete, post counts
- src/app/posts/page.tsx: public paginated post grid (12 per page), responsive 1/2/3 col layout
- src/app/posts/[slug]/page.tsx: server component, public post view with cover image, reading time, clickable tag links
- src/app/posts/[slug]/post-content.tsx: client component with highlight.js syntax highlighting for code blocks
- src/app/tags/[slug]/page.tsx: posts filtered by tag slug, responsive grid layout
- src/app/categories/page.tsx: public categories list with post counts, links to /categories/[slug]
- src/app/categories/[slug]/page.tsx: posts filtered by category slug, responsive grid layout
- src/components/post-card.tsx: post card — title, excerpt, category badge, date, reading time
- src/components/pagination.tsx: page navigation controls with Previous/Next and numbered pages
- src/components/post-form.tsx: shared create/edit form — title, slug auto-gen, tiptap editor, excerpt, cover image, category dropdown, tags multi-select, status toggle
- src/components/tiptap-editor.tsx: tiptap wrapper with toolbar (bold, italic, headings, code block, link, image, list)
DEPENDENCIES:
- uses: @tiptap/react: EditorContent, useEditor hooks
- uses: @tiptap/starter-kit: core extensions
- uses: @tiptap/extension-link: link support
- uses: @tiptap/extension-image: image via URL
- uses: @tiptap/extension-placeholder: placeholder text
- uses: highlight.js: syntax highlighting for code blocks in post content
- imports: src/lib/slugify: slug auto-generation
- imports: src/lib/reading-time: reading time estimation (words / 200 wpm)
- imports: src/lib/prisma: direct DB query in public pages
INTERFACES:
- PostForm: mode="create"|"edit", initialData? — shared form component
- PostCard: title, slug, excerpt, category, publishedAt, readingTime — post card link
- Pagination: currentPage, totalPages, basePath — page navigation
- PostContent: content=string — client component with highlight.js
- TiptapEditor: content=string, onChange=(html)=>void — rich text editor wrapper
TRAPS:
- [LOW] Public post pages use server components with direct prisma query — no API layer | FIX: acceptable for read-only public pages
- [LOW] Tags multi-select uses button toggle pattern — no search/filter for large tag sets | FIX: sufficient for small tag collections
- [LOW] Post pages use force-dynamic to prevent static generation DB errors | FIX: required for DB-dependent pages without static fallback
- [LOW] Admin category/tag pages are client components fetching via API — no SSR | FIX: acceptable for admin-only pages, requires auth
CHANGELOG:
- F-006 | add: public post listing, pagination, tag pages, reading time, syntax highlighting
- F-004 | add: admin categories/tags pages with inline create/edit/delete
- F-004 | add: public categories list and category posts pages
